    <content><![CDATA[<h2 id="Who-I-Am"><a href="#Who-I-Am" class="headerlink" title="Who I Am"></a>Who I Am</h2><p>I am a computer science graduate student focused on systems, algorithms, AI, and engineering practice.</p>
